---
source: tests/human_output.rs
description: "Auth status --json with a key the API rejects: the local report with owner_error, exit 1."
---
$ dn --json auth status
{
  "source": "env",
  "profile": null,
  "api_key_ref": null,
  "message": null,
  "auth_path": "<CONFIG_DIR>/auth.json",
  "api_url": "<API_URL>",
  "owner": null,
  "owner_error": {
    "status": 401,
    "request_id": null,
    "errors": [
      {
        "code": "ERR_UNAUTHORIZED",
        "message": "invalid API key"
      }
    ]
  }
}
--- stderr
error: Defined API error (HTTP 401)   ERR_UNAUTHORIZED: invalid API key
--- exit 1
